WEBVTT

00:39.998 --> 00:41.166
That woman…

00:42.584 --> 00:43.877
I killed her.

00:49.215 --> 00:51.468
Everyone was forced to play the game.

00:52.927 --> 00:54.137
It wasn't your fault.

00:58.016 --> 00:59.559
What the hell is all this?

01:02.937 --> 01:04.856
Who knows? I know I don't.

01:05.732 --> 01:06.649
But…

01:08.568 --> 01:11.237
It amazes me
that I'm willing to do anything

01:12.322 --> 01:13.656
just so that I can survive.

01:17.452 --> 01:19.996
If we didn't want to do that,
we might as well just die.

03:42.722 --> 03:44.474
My visa ends today.

03:53.775 --> 03:56.903
I worked so hard.
Did everything to get into that company.

03:59.364 --> 04:01.324
I even hooked up with someone I hated.

04:04.077 --> 04:06.120
And I finally got the promotion.

04:08.706 --> 04:09.999
Saori…

04:10.083 --> 04:11.876
I talked to the HR department.

04:12.794 --> 04:17.799
Cypher Bank Holdings
strongly recommends Saori Shibuki

04:17.882 --> 04:21.302
as the new team leader of AI development.

04:21.386 --> 04:24.514
SPECIAL PROMOTION FOR ASSISTANT
IN THE DEVELOPMENT TEAM

04:26.432 --> 04:27.976
I'll survive this game

04:28.935 --> 04:30.812
and return to my original life.

04:32.981 --> 04:35.316
Arisu! Karube!

04:35.817 --> 04:36.859
I can't believe it!

04:38.319 --> 04:41.906
I was so worried
when you guys weren't back this morning.

04:41.990 --> 04:44.075
It's so good to see you!

04:44.158 --> 04:46.160
Hey, Chota.

04:46.244 --> 04:47.745
Easy.

04:47.829 --> 04:49.289
Are you hurt?

04:49.372 --> 04:51.291
I'm okay.

04:54.085 --> 04:55.712
Somebody radioed in?

04:56.254 --> 04:57.297
Yeah.

05:01.926 --> 05:02.844
Thanks.

05:06.180 --> 05:07.974
If we go to that Beach place,

05:08.683 --> 05:10.268
we might be able to find something.

05:10.768 --> 05:13.271
Like where everyone in the city
disappeared to?

05:13.980 --> 05:15.898
Maybe there's an evacuation shelter.

05:16.816 --> 05:18.443
Maybe everybody's there.

05:19.110 --> 05:23.156
The closest beaches to us are
in Shonan, Izu, and Ito, right?

05:24.490 --> 05:25.491
They're so far.

05:26.034 --> 05:28.953
But we can reach them in time.

05:30.913 --> 05:32.206
So, what do we think?

05:32.832 --> 05:34.042
Should we try going?

05:35.168 --> 05:36.085
My vote is…

05:37.587 --> 05:39.756
for now, we trust whoever this is.

05:41.090 --> 05:43.092
And how is Chota supposed to go?

05:44.969 --> 05:46.804
That's a good point.

05:48.890 --> 05:50.183
And our visas…

05:51.976 --> 05:53.478
they expire today.

05:58.149 --> 06:00.026
Then we'll have to win the game today

06:00.693 --> 06:02.320
and extend your visas.

06:02.403 --> 06:03.571
Sound good?

06:04.572 --> 06:06.741
Then we'll go and look for
the Beach tomorrow.

06:23.966 --> 06:25.426
I'll go to the Beach.

06:27.220 --> 06:28.471
No matter what happens.

06:30.807 --> 06:32.225
I'll do whatever it takes.

06:36.979 --> 06:38.481
We have to believe there's hope.

06:54.831 --> 06:57.625
It amazes me
that I'm willing to do anything

06:59.085 --> 07:00.962
in order to survive.

07:04.882 --> 07:07.427
If only we could choose to die
on our own terms.

07:22.859 --> 07:23.943
Arisu?

07:30.783 --> 07:32.034
What's the matter?

07:38.124 --> 07:39.834
Nothing.

07:51.888 --> 07:53.055
Say something.

07:55.850 --> 07:57.477
"Say something"? Like what?

07:58.269 --> 08:00.938
Hm, let's see. Heard any gossip?

08:05.234 --> 08:07.862
I saw someone die right in front of me.

08:10.698 --> 08:12.158
But I survived.

08:14.952 --> 08:16.287
So what should I say?

08:18.039 --> 08:19.165
That you were glad.

08:22.960 --> 08:24.462
Glad it wasn't you.

08:28.090 --> 08:30.051
I didn't think about that, but…

08:34.805 --> 08:35.806
Guess I was.

08:38.559 --> 08:40.478
All I thought about was surviving.

08:47.109 --> 08:49.237
Yeah, I get it. I'll tell you something.

08:52.490 --> 08:53.908
On my very first game day,

08:54.575 --> 08:56.118
everyone died except me.

09:00.748 --> 09:02.458
I didn't wanna die like them.

09:05.169 --> 09:06.254
What I wanted…

09:07.964 --> 09:09.757
What I wanted was to survive.

09:33.614 --> 09:34.991
And… found it!

09:53.426 --> 09:55.094
Please be safe and all right.

10:09.191 --> 10:11.986
SHIBUYA STATION

10:13.154 --> 10:16.073
THIS WAY TO THE GAME ARENA

10:23.372 --> 10:24.582
He's late.

10:25.708 --> 10:27.418
Yeah, should we just go?

10:28.252 --> 10:30.046
No, we wait for Karube.

10:30.630 --> 10:33.174
If we don't join the game,
we could all die.

10:37.219 --> 10:38.304
Chota, let's go.

10:40.056 --> 10:42.016
They both have days left on their visa.

10:54.028 --> 10:55.029
Karube!

10:57.114 --> 10:58.157
Sorry.

10:58.240 --> 11:00.618
- I needed to get something.
- What do you mean, "sorry"?

11:05.623 --> 11:07.083
Shibuki and I…

11:07.750 --> 11:09.377
For us, there's no tomorrow.

11:12.088 --> 11:13.381
Why, what's going on?

11:14.757 --> 11:15.841
Don't be angry.

11:21.430 --> 11:23.182
We're wasting time. Let's go.

11:25.226 --> 11:26.268
Come on.

11:28.062 --> 11:29.063
Thank you.

12:30.916 --> 12:33.544
Let's do this.

12:48.184 --> 12:52.104
SHINJUKU NATURAL BOTANICAL GARDEN

13:20.841 --> 13:22.760
FEEL FREE TO USE ANY OF THESE

13:26.347 --> 13:28.766
FEEL FREE TO USE ANY OF THESE

13:28.849 --> 13:30.768
Are we gonna tear something apart?

13:32.520 --> 13:33.562
Huh…

13:38.609 --> 13:40.528
- This one.
- Huh.

13:41.153 --> 13:43.072
Those look kinda cool.

13:46.992 --> 13:48.118
What the…

14:01.131 --> 14:03.384
FACE RECOGNITION IN PROGRESS
PLEASE WAIT FOR A MOMENT

14:07.763 --> 14:09.598
Entries accepted.

14:11.350 --> 14:14.854
WELCOME! SPONSORED BY
SHINJUKU NATURAL BOTANICAL GARDEN

14:14.937 --> 14:19.275
Put on the goggles
and proceed to the garden.

14:25.698 --> 14:28.617
THIS WAY

14:53.601 --> 14:56.437
REGISTRATION IN PROGRESS
CURRENT PARTICIPANTS

15:01.483 --> 15:02.818
What is this?

15:05.446 --> 15:08.282
My goggles recognized Chota
and the target cursor turned red.

15:08.365 --> 15:10.200
Yeah, when we look at each other.

15:10.284 --> 15:11.952
It must be a tracking function.

15:13.162 --> 15:14.747
What do they want us to do this time?

15:15.956 --> 15:18.125
Registration is now closed.

15:18.208 --> 15:19.793
The game will now commence.

15:20.377 --> 15:23.589
Difficulty, Seven of Hearts.

15:23.672 --> 15:25.007
Hearts.

15:25.591 --> 15:26.842
Hearts? Isn't that…

15:28.427 --> 15:30.471
The suit of the playing cards
usually means

15:30.554 --> 15:32.139
what kind of game it's gonna be.

15:32.222 --> 15:35.142
Clubs is a team battle.
Diamonds is your wits.

15:35.225 --> 15:36.810
And as for Hearts…

15:37.394 --> 15:40.147
You play with people's hearts
and you tear them apart.

15:40.731 --> 15:42.900
Seven. Isn't that kinda difficult?

15:43.901 --> 15:45.694
Hearts are the worst.

15:45.778 --> 15:46.820
What do we do?

15:48.739 --> 15:51.533
Game, "Hide-and-seek".

15:51.617 --> 15:54.370
Rules. One person will be the wolf

15:54.453 --> 15:57.122
and the other three will be the lambs.

15:57.206 --> 16:01.251
A lamb found by the wolf
will become the next wolf

16:01.335 --> 16:04.380
and must hide so that
the wolf does not find them.

16:04.880 --> 16:06.215
Clear condition.

16:06.298 --> 16:09.760
Player who is the wolf at game's end
is the winner.

16:09.843 --> 16:11.971
Time limit, 15 minutes.

16:12.054 --> 16:14.014
When 15 minutes have passed,

16:14.515 --> 16:17.851
the collars fastened to the lambs' necks
will explode.

16:17.935 --> 16:19.061
What?

16:19.728 --> 16:21.021
"Explode"?

16:21.522 --> 16:23.273
What does she mean?

16:25.067 --> 16:26.610
Do you know what this means?

16:27.695 --> 16:28.779
Know what?

16:29.571 --> 16:32.241
This means only one player will survive.

16:33.325 --> 16:34.410
What?

16:36.036 --> 16:37.246
We'll play hide-and-seek…

16:38.747 --> 16:41.000
Whoever's the wolf
at the end of the game wins.

16:41.625 --> 16:43.335
The other three will be dead.

16:44.753 --> 16:46.588
It's really very simple.

16:48.924 --> 16:51.677
The first wolf is ID number

16:51.760 --> 16:57.599
1000247.

16:57.683 --> 16:59.518
Chota Segawa.

17:06.275 --> 17:07.234
Really?

17:07.818 --> 17:09.528
Game time limit.

17:10.863 --> 17:13.615
Fifteen minutes, commence.

17:24.293 --> 17:27.212
Stop it, Chota! If you try to take it off,
the collar might explode!

17:27.296 --> 17:29.339
- I don't care!
- Stop it!

17:29.423 --> 17:31.091
Leave me alone!

17:37.389 --> 17:38.390
Arisu?

17:47.649 --> 17:50.527
When we lock eyes,
the wolf role is passed on.

17:51.195 --> 17:52.821
That's the catch in this game.

17:54.073 --> 17:55.991
If the wolf doesn't survive,

17:56.075 --> 17:58.077
it's because the lambs killed it.

17:58.786 --> 18:00.579
What do we do, Arisu?

18:03.415 --> 18:04.541
It's bullshit!

18:11.924 --> 18:12.841
Shibuki!

18:12.925 --> 18:15.427
The one that needs to hide
in this game is the wolf!

18:15.511 --> 18:18.347
- Are we going to die?
- You will if you do nothing.

18:18.430 --> 18:19.598
But I'll be fine.

18:20.265 --> 18:21.225
Shibuki!

18:21.308 --> 18:22.142
Karube!

18:31.068 --> 18:32.736
Stop running!

18:39.910 --> 18:41.120
Shibuki!

18:53.090 --> 18:56.009
TROPICAL RAINFOREST

19:23.620 --> 19:24.621
Come out!

19:27.124 --> 19:28.375
Shibuki!

19:46.810 --> 19:48.061
Ah!

19:57.029 --> 19:59.489
Can you read me, Shibuki?

20:00.657 --> 20:01.992
Shibuki!

20:02.743 --> 20:03.827
Stop running.

20:04.328 --> 20:06.830
Let's think of a way out of this together.

20:06.914 --> 20:08.790
I'm sorry.

20:09.458 --> 20:10.542
I'm sorry.

20:15.797 --> 20:18.884
There's no point apologizing now, huh?

20:18.967 --> 20:20.344
Huh?

20:20.427 --> 20:22.721
Turn around!

20:23.388 --> 20:24.765
Stop it, Karube!

20:24.848 --> 20:26.642
Come on, come on!

20:29.186 --> 20:30.687
Turn around!

21:09.351 --> 21:11.770
You fucking bitch!

21:17.067 --> 21:18.443
Karube!

21:24.157 --> 21:25.033
Arisu!

21:26.201 --> 21:28.370
Both of you, enough! Stop it!

21:28.453 --> 21:31.206
If we work together,
we might be able to figure this out!

21:31.290 --> 21:34.001
You're so naive, this is a Hearts game!

21:44.469 --> 21:46.471
What's happening to us?

21:50.225 --> 21:51.643
You're turning against each other!

21:51.727 --> 21:52.978
Damn you, Arisu!

21:53.687 --> 21:55.355
We're friends, right?

21:58.442 --> 22:01.361
Ten minutes remaining.

22:04.990 --> 22:05.991
Arisu!

22:06.074 --> 22:07.826
O Holy Mother…

22:08.910 --> 22:10.120
Please forgive us

22:10.203 --> 22:12.247
- for our mortal sins.
- Arisu!

22:13.540 --> 22:15.917
Our smiles are the light of hope.

22:17.002 --> 22:19.921
And you, Holy Mother, appear to us
when we smile.

22:21.715 --> 22:23.133
O Holy Mother…

22:24.509 --> 22:26.053
- Please forgive us…
- Arisu!

22:26.136 --> 22:27.596
…for our mortal sins…

22:29.014 --> 22:31.641
Our smiles are the light of hope.

22:32.809 --> 22:36.188
And you, Holy Mother, appear to us
when we smile.

22:42.569 --> 22:44.529
O Holy Mother…

22:45.947 --> 22:48.325
Our smiles are the light of hope.

22:49.659 --> 22:52.287
The Holy Mother will appear when we smile.

22:59.878 --> 23:01.880
Do you want to live or die?

23:02.464 --> 23:03.965
All I need is some time!

23:04.049 --> 23:06.843
I'll think of a way
to get out of this game!

23:06.927 --> 23:08.887
You'll think of a way out, huh?

23:11.723 --> 23:14.017
You just want to be the only survivor.

23:16.186 --> 23:18.522
It doesn't matter to you if you're dead.

23:20.315 --> 23:21.566
Make me the wolf.

23:22.192 --> 23:24.069
Your life is shit anyway!

23:25.695 --> 23:30.117
Where's the justice when someone
who has the desire to live dies?

23:32.035 --> 23:33.120
Arisu.

23:35.038 --> 23:37.666
We can't all survive in this game!

23:48.552 --> 23:49.719
Chota!

23:49.803 --> 23:52.556
- Let me go!
- Go! Run!

23:54.850 --> 23:55.725
Let me go!

23:57.185 --> 23:58.395
Stop!

24:03.650 --> 24:05.777
Let me go!

24:05.861 --> 24:08.738
I took care of you!

24:09.322 --> 24:11.783
You don't know
what your friends really are!

24:12.409 --> 24:13.743
Let me go!

24:15.245 --> 24:16.079
Let me go!

24:16.163 --> 24:18.790
- O Holy Mother…
- Let me go!

24:22.669 --> 24:24.838
Eight minutes remaining.

24:27.174 --> 24:28.884
Let go!

24:38.226 --> 24:39.978
Arisu!

24:44.649 --> 24:46.610
Where are you, Arisu? Come out!

24:47.903 --> 24:49.362
Come on, damn it.

24:50.489 --> 24:53.074
You're just gonna hide
until time runs out?

24:53.158 --> 24:54.576
Ugh, shit!

24:57.245 --> 24:59.372
Come on, Arisu.

24:59.456 --> 25:01.374
You were playing us all.

25:02.918 --> 25:05.837
And you said
it'll work out if we cooperate.

25:08.089 --> 25:11.551
From the very start of this,
you wanted to be the only survivor!

26:01.601 --> 26:04.062
I don't know what to do.

26:04.145 --> 26:06.690
Get off of me!

26:06.773 --> 26:07.691
I'm sorry.

26:08.942 --> 26:10.026
I'm sorry!

26:11.820 --> 26:14.614
Ha!
What's the use of saying sorry?

26:14.698 --> 26:16.157
Arisu!

26:19.452 --> 26:21.246
In the end, that's…

26:21.329 --> 26:22.414
all you ever do.

26:27.836 --> 26:30.171
Ever since
you dropped out of school…

26:33.091 --> 26:35.844
All you do is say sorry!

26:35.927 --> 26:37.929
- Arisu!
- I'm sorry.

26:38.555 --> 26:39.639
I'm sorry!

26:40.807 --> 26:41.933
I'm sorry.

26:50.275 --> 26:52.402
Congratulations
on your acceptance, Hajime.

26:52.485 --> 26:54.821
You really accomplished something.

26:54.904 --> 26:56.990
I know your mother would be happy too.

26:57.073 --> 26:59.618
And this is just the beginning.

27:01.244 --> 27:03.747
I'll see it through.
I don't want to end up like Ryohei.

27:04.372 --> 27:08.126
I can't teach Ryohei anything,
but you're different.

27:08.209 --> 27:09.919
Inside you, there's ambition.

27:10.920 --> 27:13.173
You're very different from your brother.

27:15.842 --> 27:18.595
Ryohei, why don't you come over
and join us?

27:30.815 --> 27:34.069
If you're happy being a loser…

27:35.403 --> 27:38.281
…then let me be the wolf!

27:42.994 --> 27:44.663
Arisu!

27:53.421 --> 27:56.341
Five minutes remaining.

27:58.551 --> 28:00.053
I've had enough.

28:01.930 --> 28:06.476
I don't care who survives in the end.

28:11.523 --> 28:12.524
But…

28:14.401 --> 28:17.696
But I don't want it to end this way.

28:40.051 --> 28:42.721
Is this about Arisu and Chota again?

28:48.685 --> 28:52.063
You know, you really are very kind.

29:37.734 --> 29:39.319
I don't expect anything from you

29:39.402 --> 29:41.571
and you never fail to disappoint me
in that regard.

29:43.239 --> 29:44.365
So, did you…

30:32.789 --> 30:34.374
This noodle is so good!

30:39.462 --> 30:41.172
You look like you can't eat noodles…

30:45.301 --> 30:46.386
Come on, man!

30:47.262 --> 30:49.138
Come on, Karube, faster!

31:10.994 --> 31:12.161
Guys.

31:14.873 --> 31:17.750
I got this… dream.

31:18.585 --> 31:22.255
I wanna buy a huge farm in Australia.

31:23.423 --> 31:28.511
Then I'll invite you guys over,
and we'll drink beer in the morning.

31:28.595 --> 31:30.221
That sounds nice!

31:30.305 --> 31:32.765
And I'll deliver
triple grade-A steaks to you

31:32.849 --> 31:35.518
with my drone delivery service.

31:35.602 --> 31:38.563
My drones will be fully automated,
I'll develop an app for them!

31:40.398 --> 31:43.610
All right then.
Cheers to our future.

31:43.693 --> 31:44.861
Cheers!

31:44.944 --> 31:46.946
You better keep your promise,
you hear?

32:38.748 --> 32:40.917
Three minutes remaining.

32:53.429 --> 32:56.140
Guys, I'll… quit.

32:59.060 --> 33:02.689
I'll… drop out of this game.

33:06.275 --> 33:07.860
You're all…

33:09.278 --> 33:11.280
You're all that matters to me.

33:14.158 --> 33:16.494
If someone has to lose at this game…

33:18.079 --> 33:19.998
…let it be me.

33:23.960 --> 33:25.294
I'm leaving the game.

33:28.506 --> 33:32.051
Karube? Chota? Karube.

33:35.763 --> 33:37.557
Karube, Chota?

33:45.106 --> 33:46.232
Karube!

33:46.941 --> 33:48.234
Chota!

33:49.152 --> 33:52.363
Guys!

33:55.825 --> 33:56.909
Chota!

33:59.203 --> 34:00.038
Chota!

34:01.539 --> 34:03.082
Where are you?

34:03.166 --> 34:04.208
Chota!

34:11.799 --> 34:14.010
Chota!

34:16.804 --> 34:17.930
Chota?

34:19.849 --> 34:20.892
Where are you?

34:20.975 --> 34:23.561
Chota!

34:23.644 --> 34:26.564
YOU BECOME THE WOLF IF YOU ARE FOUND.
HIDE SO THAT THE WOLF WON'T FIND YOU.

34:27.148 --> 34:28.232
Karube!

34:29.400 --> 34:30.610
Chota!

34:33.321 --> 34:35.031
Come out! Let's talk!

34:36.324 --> 34:37.450
Guys!

34:38.201 --> 34:41.120
HIDE SO THAT THE WOLF WON'T FIND YOU

34:46.709 --> 34:49.378
Karube! Where are you?

34:51.672 --> 34:53.716
Why won't you guys answer me?

34:56.594 --> 34:58.096
Karube!

35:02.225 --> 35:06.145
HIDE WELL, LAMB

35:06.229 --> 35:08.523
Where are you guys?

35:09.941 --> 35:11.067
Karube!

35:13.986 --> 35:15.279
Chota!

35:18.241 --> 35:19.534
Chota!

35:21.536 --> 35:23.079
Karube!

35:23.162 --> 35:25.248
Come out, please!

35:25.998 --> 35:27.917
Stop yelling.

35:30.128 --> 35:31.254
Karube!

35:40.388 --> 35:42.390
Always laughing like idiots,

35:43.641 --> 35:45.309
drinking the night away…

35:47.770 --> 35:49.355
When I'm with you guys,

35:50.189 --> 35:52.275
I forget about all my problems.

35:54.068 --> 35:55.862
Hey, do you guys remember?

35:55.945 --> 35:59.740
That fricking hot day
when we made noodles with shaved ice?

35:59.824 --> 36:02.493
Karube, where are you?

36:04.620 --> 36:05.913
Karube!

36:09.792 --> 36:12.336
We laughed a lot that day, didn't we?

36:15.673 --> 36:16.966
Chota?

36:17.049 --> 36:20.094
Chota laughed so hard
that noodles came out from his nose.

36:22.013 --> 36:24.932
I thought we said
we'd keep that our secret.

36:25.016 --> 36:26.976
Where are you, Chota?

36:27.643 --> 36:28.853
Karube!

36:30.271 --> 36:31.522
Arisu.

36:33.482 --> 36:34.817
Live for us.

36:45.411 --> 36:47.038
Karube!

36:47.121 --> 36:48.581
Chota!

36:48.664 --> 36:51.042
Thirty seconds remaining.

37:02.929 --> 37:03.888
It can't be me!

37:04.639 --> 37:06.599
I shouldn't be the one to live!

37:07.808 --> 37:09.101
Twenty seconds.

37:09.185 --> 37:10.353
I'm behind you.

